Abstraction

Allowing a user to interact with a higher-level (more big picture) part of the program

Example:
	Using an oven.
	A user doesn't have to know all of the mechanical and electrical aspects to use the oven, they just turn a nob.

Also referred to as
	information hiding
	encapsulation

